t":"page","_id":"cmuzdjhgt000294qn6ypqbx4b","content":"<h2 id=\"关于\"><a class=\"markdownIt-Anchor\" href=\"#关于\"></a> 关于</h2>\n<p>鉴于人脑不可能一直记得学习的内容，需要时刻温习，所以建立个人博客网站方便自己复习，也尽可能的提供个人学习经历，期望能为社区做贡献</p>\n","excerpt":"","more":"<h2 id=\"关于\"><a class=\"markdownIt-Anchor\" href=\"#关于\"></a> 关于</h2>\n<p>鉴于人脑不可能一直记得学习的内容，需要时刻温习，所以建立个人博客网站方便自己复习，也尽可能的提供个人学习经历，期望能为社区做贡献</p>\n"}],"Post":[{"title":"Hello World","_content":"Welcome to [Hexo](https://hexo.io/)! This is your very first post. Check [documentation](https://hexo.io/docs/) for more info. If you get any problems when using Hexo, you can find the answer in [troubleshooting](https://hexo.io/docs/troubleshooting.html) or you can ask me on [GitHub](https://github.com/hexojs/hexo/issues).\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### Create a new post\n\n``` bash\n$ hexo new \"My New Post\"\n```\n\nMore info: [Writing](https://hexo.io/docs/writing.html)\n\n### Run server\n\n``` bash\n$ hexo server\n```\n\nMore info: [Server](https://hexo.io/docs/server.html)\n\n### Generate static files\n\n``` bash\n$ hexo generate\n```\n\nMore info: [Generating](https://hexo.io/docs/generating.html)\n\n### Deploy to remote sites\n\n``` bash\n$ hexo deploy\n```\n\nMore info: [Deployment](https://hexo.io/docs/one-command-deployment.html)\n","source":"_posts/hello-world.md","raw":"---\ntitle: Hello World\n---\nWelcome to [Hexo](https://hexo.io/)! This is your very first post. Check [documentation](https://hexo.io/docs/) for more info. If you get any problems when using Hexo, you can find the answer in [troubleshooting](https://hexo.io/docs/troubleshooting.html) or you can ask me on [GitHub](https://github.com/hexojs/hexo/issues).\n\n## Quick Start\n\n### Create a new post\n\n``` bash\n$ hexo new \"My New Post\"\n```\n\nMore info: [Writing](https://hexo.io/docs/writing.html)\n\n### Run server\n\n``` bash\n$ hexo server\n```\n\nMore info: [Server](https://hexo.io/docs/server.html)\n\n### Generate static files\n\n``` bash\n$ hexo generate\n```\n\nMore info: [Generating](https://hexo.io/docs/generating.html)\n\n### Deploy to remote sites\n\n``` bash\n$ hexo deploy\n```\n\nMore info: [Deployment](https://hexo.io/docs/one-command-deployment.html)\n","slug":"hello-world","published":1,"date":"2026-10-07T09:41:31.340Z","updated":"2026-10-07T09:39:01.001Z","comments":1,"layout":"post","photos":[],"_id":"cmuzdjhgs000194qngy71ee45","content":"<p>Welcome to <a href=\"https://hexo.io/\">Hexo</a>! This is your very first post. Check <a href=\"https://hexo.io/docs/\">documentation</a> for more info. If you get any problems when using Hexo, you can find the answer in <a href=\"https://hexo.io/docs/troubleshooting.html\">troubleshooting</a> or you can ask me on <a href=\"https://github.com/hexojs/hexo/issues\">GitHub</a>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"quick-start\"><a class=\"markdownIt-Anchor\" href=\"#quick-start\"></a> Quick Start</h2>\n<h3 id=\"create-a-new-post\"><a class=\"markdownIt-Anchor\" href=\"#create-a-new-post\"></a> Create a new post</h3>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">$ hexo new <span class=\"string\">&quot;My New Post&quot;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<p>More info: <a href=\"https://hexo.io/docs/writing.html\">Writing</a></p>\n<h3 id=\"run-server\"><a class=\"markdownIt-Anchor\" href=\"#run-server\"></a> Run server</h3>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">$ hexo server</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<p>More info: <a href=\"https://hexo.io/docs/server.html\">Server</a></p>\n<h3 id=\"generate-static-files\"><a class=\"markdownIt-Anchor\" href=\"#generate-static-files\"></a> Generate static files</h3>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">$ hexo generate</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<p>More info: <a href=\"https://hexo.io/docs/generating.html\">Generating</a></p>\n<h3 id=\"deploy-to-remote-sites\"><a class=\"markdownIt-Anchor\" href=\"#deploy-to-remote-sites\"></a> Deploy to remote sites</h3>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">$ hexo deploy</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<p>More info: <a href=\"https://hexo.io/docs/one-command-deployment.html\">Deployment</a></p>\n","excerpt":"","more":"<p>Welcome to <a href=\"https://hexo.io/\">Hexo</a>! This is your very first post. Check <a href=\"https://hexo.io/docs/\">documentation</a> for more info. If you get any problems when using Hexo, you can find the answer in <a href=\"https://hexo.io/docs/troubleshooting.html\">troubleshooting</a> or you can ask me on <a href=\"https://github.com/hexojs/hexo/issues\">GitHub</a>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"quick-start\"><a class=\"markdownIt-Anchor\" href=\"#quick-start\"></a> Quick Start</h2>\n<h3 id=\"create-a-new-post\"><a class=\"markdownIt-Anchor\" href=\"#create-a-new-post\"></a> Create a new post</h3>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">$ hexo new <span class=\"string\">&quot;My New Post&quot;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<p>More info: <a href=\"https://hexo.io/docs/writing.html\">Writing</a></p>\n<h3 id=\"run-server\"><a class=\"markdownIt-Anchor\" href=\"#run-server\"></a> Run server</h3>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">$ hexo server</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<p>More info: <a href=\"https://hexo.io/docs/server.html\">Server</a></p>\n<h3 id=\"generate-static-files\"><a class=\"markdownIt-Anchor\" href=\"#generate-static-files\"></a> Generate static files</h3>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">$ hexo generate</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<p>More info: <a href=\"https://hexo.io/docs/generating.html\">Generating</a></p>\n<h3 id=\"deploy-to-remote-sites\"><a class=\"markdownIt-Anchor\" href=\"#deploy-to-remote-sites\"></a> Deploy to remote sites</h3>\n<figure class=\"highlight bash\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">$ hexo deploy</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<p>More info: <a href=\"https://hexo.io/docs/one-command-deployment.html\">Deployment</a></p>\n"},{"title":"建站","banner":"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/DimMeteor/Dim-picture/picgo/Minecraft_Fall_Drop_Campaign_Key_Art_DotNet_Downloadable_Wallpaper_414x414.png","sticky":false,"comment":false,"date":"2026-10-08T07:59:52.000Z","_content":"\n## 教程网站\n``` bash\nhttps://www.cnblogs.com/coder-Jason/p/15821938.html\n```\n## Hexo文档\n``` bash\nhttps://hexo.io/zh-cn/docs/\n```\n\n## 使用主题reimu\n``` bash\nhttps://github.com/D-Sketon/hexo-theme-reimu\n```\n\n## 用git连接github\n先在本地仓库目录下启动cmd或者git bash\n创建连接信息\n``` bash\ngit config --global user.name \"DimMeteor\"\ngit config --global user.email \"1592497663@qq.com\"\n```\n建立远程链接\n``` bash\ngit remote add origin git@github.com:DimMeteor/Dim-blog\n```\n修改远程链接仓库\n``` bash\ngit remote set-url origin git@github.com:DimMeteor/Dim-blog.git\n```\n将仓库内容全部推入暂存区\n``` bash\ngit add *\n```\n将嵌套仓库(引用了别的仓库)添加暂存权限(需重新推入)\n``` bash\ngit submodule add https://github.com/D-Sketon/hexo-theme-reimu.git themes/reimu\n```\n将暂存区内容提交到header\n``` bash\ngit commit -m \"代码提交信息\"\n```\n将暂存区内容提交到仓库\n``` bash\ngit push origin master\n```\ngit工作流示意图\n![git工作流示意图](https://www.runoob.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/05/trees.png)\n图片来源:[菜鸟教程](https://www